{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101222","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101222/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101222/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101222/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101222","id":2772722449,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6lRGMR","number":101222,"title":"Using RefCounted objects as thread bind parameters causes segfault on exit","user":{"login":"SpiceOctopus","id":59936251,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5OTM2MjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59936251?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpiceOctopus","html_url":"https://github.com/SpiceOctopus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpiceOctopus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpiceOctopus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpiceOctopus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpiceOctopus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpiceOctopus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpiceOctopus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpiceOctopus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpiceOctopus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpiceOctopus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-01-07T12:27:05Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T14:42:26Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.3\n\n### System information\n\nLinux 6.12.7 and Windows 11. Appears to be system independent.\n\n### Issue description\n\nBinding an object that inherits from RefCounted to a callable that is passed to WorkerThreadPool.add_task() will produce a stale reference.\n\nI am not entirely sure at which point it is missing a decrement (or if that is something I should be handling manually).  \nThe behavior does seem unintended.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```\nfunc _ready():\n\tvar test = TestObject.new() # empty object that extends RefCounted\n\tprint(test.get_reference_count()) # prints 1\n\tvar id = WorkerThreadPool.add_task(threadproc.bind(test))\n\tWorkerThreadPool.wait_for_task_completion(id)\n\tprint(test.get_reference_count()) # prints 2\n\nfunc threadproc(obj : RefCounted):\n\tprint(obj.get_reference_count()) # prints 3\n\n```\n\nRun as a build outside of the editor, close the program -> segfault on exit. On Windows the program will crash on exit and write EventLog entries.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Archive.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18332421/Archive.zip)\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101222/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101222/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}